vidence still points to a comfortable Pillen re-election.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0219, "margin": -11.34}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0357, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0267, "margin": -11.0}]}